            "sid": "DAN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Danieli yaaja ye Arioki, kyabazinga ye yali alagiire okwita abantu abagezigezi ab'omu Babilonia. Yaamukoba ati: “Otazikiriza bantu bagezigezi abo ab'omu Babilonia. Ntwala mu maiso ga kyabazinga mmukobere amakulu g'ekirooto kye yaloota.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
